cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Adaptive Self-Calibrating OFDM-Based Acoustic Communication System for Reliable Cross-Device File Transfer"
abstract: >-
  An OFDM modem that sends files between the speaker and microphone of ordinary
  devices in the 4-12 kHz band, with pilot-based channel estimation, MMSE
  equalisation, adaptive tracking, Stage-1 self-calibration, a rate-1/2
  convolutional code and sampling-clock-offset correction. Signal Processing
  project, BS Electronic Systems, IIT Madras.
type: software
